# Reference repositories fetched by bootstrap.py. Never committed: they are
# other people's code, one of them carries no license grant at all, and pinning
# beats vendoring.
#
# ANCHORED to the repository root deliberately. An unanchored `references/`
# would match ANY directory of that name at any depth — including
# `skills/*/references/`, which is where skill resource bundles live. That
# silently excluded six reference files from a commit once already.
/references/

# Run artifacts. These hold real target data, real evidence, and possibly
# unredacted snapshots taken before redaction was wired in — never publish them.
runs/
*.jsonl

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# Local overrides
sources.local.yaml
*.local.yaml
